## 14. Error Codes Reference

| `error_code` | HTTP | Meaning | Fix |
|---|---|---|---|
| `INSUFFICIENT_INPUT` | 422 | No cadastral image AND no centroid provided | Provide at least one |
| `IMAGE_TOO_LARGE` | 413 | Upload > MAX_CADASTRAL_IMAGE_MB | Compress before upload |
| `UNSUPPORTED_FORMAT` | 422 | File not JPEG / PNG / GeoTIFF | Convert format |
| `LOW_DOCUMENT_QUALITY` | 422 | Quality score below threshold | Provide higher quality scan |
| `GCP_INSUFFICIENT` | 422 | Fewer than gcp_min_count GNSS points | Add more GCPs to CSV |
| `DATUM_MISMATCH` | 422 | Source datum not recognised | Use `"Everest 1830"` or `"WGS84"` |
| `SEGMENTATION_FAILED` | 500 | SAM / U-Net could not find boundaries | Check image orientation/quality |
| `SUBDIVISION_FAILED` | 500 | GNN could not partition into n_subdivisions | Reduce n_subdivisions or check area |
| `RECORD_FUSION_FAILED` | 500 | Spatial matching failed | Check revenue record text format |
| `ANALYSIS_ERROR` | 500 | General internal error | Check server logs |
| `SAM_NOT_AVAILABLE` | 503 | SAM checkpoint not found | Check `SAM_CHECKPOINT_PATH` |
| `COORDS_OUT_OF_BOUNDS` | 422 | Centroid outside Palghar district bbox | Check coordinate values |
| `NL_MODEL_NOT_LOADED` | 503 | IndicBERT model not loaded | Check `INDIC_BERT_MODEL` env var |

