## Open Questions

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Q1: SAM checkpoint size** — The SAM ViT-B checkpoint is ~375 MB. Should it be downloaded at Docker build time (larger image, faster startup) or at runtime (smaller image, slower cold start)?

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Q2: PostGIS vs Firestore for golden records** — The Advante pipeline uses PostGIS for spatial queries. VanMitra currently uses Firestore. Should we use Firestore with WKT strings for now and migrate to PostGIS later, or set up a PostGIS instance from the start?

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Q3: NL Assistant model** — IndicBERT requires HuggingFace download (~400 MB). Should the NL assistant be powered by the existing Gemini API (already integrated via Firebase AI Logic) instead of IndicBERT, to save memory?

> [!NOTE]
> **Q4: Survey number source** — For Ozar village specifically, will real 7/12 Utara / Khata records be available, or should Stage 5 use the `Ozar_Village_Dataset_final_f.csv` as the matching source?

